        "title": "不禁 + reaction",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "不禁 introduces an involuntary reaction. It does not prohibit the reaction or describe a deliberate decision.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他不禁笑了。",
                "pinyin": "tā bùjīn xiào le 。",
                "meaning": "He could not help laughing.",
                "audio": "58a63aa6c598287712d5e3a4312d7e9d074652e8ef8d64c3bddd79135d2a2479"
              },
              {
                "text": "我不禁想起了家。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ bùjīn xiǎngqǐ le jiā 。",
                "meaning": "I could not help thinking of home.",
